      drill:
        "Write four scenarios where a former SDA conflates a bad church experience with a doctrinal rejection. For each scenario: (a) Identify the specific experience. (b) Identify the specific doctrine being rejected. (c) Show that the experience and the doctrine are logically independent. (d) Write a compassionate response that validates the experience while inviting doctrinal re-examination.",
